#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to use IBM Cloud to manage users with IBM Cloud accounts"
msgstr ""
"Cara menggunakan IBM Cloud untuk mengurus pengguna yang mempunyai akaun IBM "
"Cloud"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage IBM Cloud users"
msgstr "Urus pengguna IBM Cloud"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Manage IBM Cloud users {#manage-ibm-cloud-users}"
msgstr "Urus pengguna IBM Cloud {#manage-ibm-cloud-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide demonstrates how to use IBM Cloud&reg; to enable users who have "
"IBM Cloud accounts and gives instructions for users to access the "
"environment.\n"
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini menunjukkan cara menggunakan IBM Cloud&reg; untuk mendayakan "
"pengguna yang mempunyai akaun IBM Cloud dan memberikan arahan untuk pengguna"
" mengakses persekitaran.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To manage ID provider users instead, follow the instructions in the [Manage "
"ID providers](/guides/manage-appid) topic.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengurus pengguna penyedia ID sebaliknya, ikut arahan dalam topik "
"[Urus penyedia ID](/guides/manage-appid).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Steps {#steps}"
msgstr "Langkah-langkah {#steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these high-level steps to manage IBM Cloud users:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ikut langkah-langkah peringkat tinggi ini untuk mengurus pengguna IBM "
"Cloud:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure that the users that you want to invite have IBM Cloud accounts.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan pengguna yang ingin anda jemput mempunyai akaun IBM Cloud.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to IAM and [invite users](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/users/invite_users)\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Users cannot be managed until they accept the invitation and log in at least once.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Pergi ke IAM dan [jemput pengguna](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/users/invite_users)\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Pengguna tidak boleh diurus sehingga mereka menerima jemputan dan log masuk sekurang-kurangnya sekali.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Optional: Modify users' project assignments and access groups from "
"[IAM](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/users).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pilihan: Ubah suai tugasan projek dan kumpulan akses pengguna daripada "
"[IAM.](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/users)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"user-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"user-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "User flow {#user-flow}"
msgstr "Aliran pengguna {#user-flow}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The user accepts an invitation, then logs on through the [IBM Cloud "
"portal](https://cloud.ibm.com/).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengguna menerima jemputan, kemudian log masuk melalui [portal IBM "
"Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The user creates an API key by going to ([Manage → Access (IAM) → API "
"keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys)).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengguna mencipta kunci API dengan pergi ke ([Urus → Akses (IAM) → Kunci "
"API](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys)).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For further information, users can review [Install Qiskit](/guides/install-"
"qiskit).\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk maklumat lanjut, pengguna boleh semak [Pasang "
"Qiskit.](/guides/install-qiskit)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"steps-cloud-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"steps-cloud-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Example scenario {#example-scenario}"
msgstr "Senario contoh {#example-scenario}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "This example creates the following setup:\n"
msgstr "Contoh ini mencipta persediaan berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "There are two projects, `ml` and `finance`.\n"
msgstr "Terdapat dua projek, `ml` dan `finance`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `ml` project should have access to the service instances `QR-ml` and "
"`QR-common`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Projek `ml` sepatutnya mempunyai akses ke instans perkhidmatan `QR-ml` dan "
"`QR-common`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `finance` project should have access to the service instances `QR-"
"finance` and `QR-common`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Projek `finance` sepatutnya mempunyai akses ke instans perkhidmatan `QR-"
"finance` dan `QR-common`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "There are three users:\n"
msgstr "Terdapat tiga pengguna:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Fatima should have access to the `ml` project.\n"
msgstr "Fatima sepatutnya mempunyai akses ke projek `ml`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Ravi should have access to the `finance` project.\n"
msgstr "Ravi sepatutnya mempunyai akses ke projek `finance`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Amyra should have access to both projects.\n"
msgstr "Amyra sepatutnya mempunyai akses ke kedua-dua projek.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "It uses access groups without resource groups.\n"
msgstr "Ia menggunakan kumpulan akses tanpa kumpulan sumber.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Users are defined in IBM Cloud and project assignments are done there as "
"well.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengguna ditentukan dalam IBM Cloud dan tugasan projek juga dilakukan di "
"sana.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Users should be able to delete jobs.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna sepatutnya boleh memadam kerja.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The steps to implement this setup are:\n"
msgstr "Langkah-langkah untuk melaksanakan persediaan ini adalah:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Cloud administrator creates three service instances: `QR-ml`, `QR "
"finance`, and `QR-common`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pentadbir Cloud mencipta tiga instans perkhidmatan: `QR-ml`, `QR finance`, "
"dan `QR-common`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Cloud administrator creates a custom rule that includes the `quantum-"
"computing.job.delete` action.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pentadbir Cloud mencipta peraturan kustom yang menyertakan tindakan "
"`quantum-computing.job.delete`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The Cloud administrator creates two access groups:\n"
msgstr "Pentadbir Cloud mencipta dua kumpulan akses:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The `ml` access group can access `QR-ml` and `QR-common`.\n"
msgstr "Kumpulan akses `ml` boleh mengakses `QR-ml` dan `QR-common`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The `finance` access group can access `QR-finance` and `QR-common`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kumpulan akses `finance` boleh mengakses `QR-finance` dan `QR-common`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Cloud administrator invites cloud users to the appropriate project. "
"Specifically, they invite and assign users to an access group that includes "
"the project.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pentadbir Cloud menjemput pengguna awan ke projek yang sesuai. Secara "
"khusus, mereka menjemput dan menugaskan pengguna ke kumpulan akses yang "
"menyertakan projek.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Fatima is added to the \"ml\" access group.\n"
msgstr "Fatima ditambahkan ke kumpulan akses \"ml\".\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Ravi is added to the \"finance\" access group.\n"
msgstr "Ravi ditambahkan ke kumpulan akses \"finance\".\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Amyra is added to both the \"ml\" and \"finance\" access groups.\n"
msgstr "Amyra ditambahkan ke kedua-dua kumpulan akses \"ml\" dan \"finance\".\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Users can log in through the IBM Cloud portal, create API keys, and work "
"with their projects' service instances.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengguna boleh log masuk melalui portal IBM Cloud, mencipta kunci API, dan "
"bekerja dengan instans perkhidmatan projek mereka.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"   * See [IBM Cloud SAML Federation Guide](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) for more information.\n"
"   * Refer to the full [App ID documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"   * Lihat [Panduan Federasi SAML IBM Cloud](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"
"   * Rujuk [dokumentasi App ID](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started) yang lengkap.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
